Z||000000||mrfixit58||02-03-2000||08:33 AM||||Just thought I'd share my other Pontiac project with you. It's 69 Firebird. The car is mostly original with the exception of the color and the transmission. The color is a custom metallic blue, base coat clear coat. It has a 350cu 2bbl numbers matching motor and a TH350 transmission (originally a TH400. It has factory PS, PDB, & A/C. Interior is standard Parchment with AM radio and center console. Everything works and looks almost new.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/69frnt.JPG"> <P>I spent about 15 months resotoring this car and it runs and drives great. I did all the work myself except for the installation of the new seat covers.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/69interior.JPG"> <P>This car is for sale. I'm asking $9500. Part of the proceds will go to fund my 87 Fireo GT project which (I hope) will include a 3800 SC motor. I'm in the Tampa, Florida area if anyone is or knows anyone who may be interested. My profile has my E-mail address.<P>Thanks,<BR>Roy L.<BR>||||reg||6
